OL,3,GNEWSAManhunt after prisoner escapes
OL,4,ALondon medical unit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA manhunt has been launched after a
OL,7,Fprisoner forced his way out of a
OL,8,Fmedical facility in south-east London.
OL,10,FAnthony Lloyd, 38, was last seen at
OL,11,Fabout 16:10 BST on Friday, heading from
OL,12,Fa unit in Lewisham towards Catford, the
OL,13,FMetropolitan Police said.
OL,15,FOfficers believe he poses a risk to
OL,16,Fhimself and the public, and have warned
OL,17,Fpeople not to approach him.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
